        <p>Reliable power is essential for profitable wash plant operations. Whether using diesel generators or electric hookups, understanding power requirements helps you plan costs, select appropriate equipment, and avoid expensive mistakes that can shut down your operation.</p>

        <p>Most mining operations rely on diesel generators due to remote locations, but each option has advantages depending on your situation.</p>

